#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Kernel versions in series 4.1 through 4.4.1 have a broken RAID "
"implementation. Use a kernel with version at or above 4.4.2."
msgstr ""
"As versões do núcleo na série 4.1 a 4.4.1 tem uma implementação de RAID "
"quebrada. Use um núcleo com versão igual ou superior a 4.4.2."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:88
#, xml-text
msgid "Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Enable the following options in the kernel configuration and recompile the "
"kernel, if necessary.  Only the RAID types desired are required."
msgstr ""
"Habilite as seguintes opções na configuração do núcleo e recompile o núcleo,"
" se necessário. Somente os tipos de RAID desejados são exigidos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of mdadm"
msgstr "Instalação do mdadm"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Build <application>mdadm</application> by running the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Construa o <application>mdadm</application> executando o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:119
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a working test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste funcional."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:159
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make BINDIR=/usr/sbin install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make BINDIR=/usr/sbin install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#.  and also versions of
#.       <command>
#. mdassemble</command>. These all need to be manually installed.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/mdadm.xml:167
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>make everything</command>: This optional target creates extra "
"programs, particularly a statically-linked version of "
"<command>mdadm</command>.  This needs to be manually installed."
msgstr ""
"<command>make everything</command>: Esse alvo opcional cria aplicativos "
"extras, particularmente uma versão vinculada estaticamente do "
"<command>mdadm</command>. Isso precisa ser instalado manualmente."

